{
  "dom_id": "step-8706",
  "name": "Example: \n                    Identifying Congruent Segments on a Number Line",
  "problem": "![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14151148/assets/8bc5a70179a245c26f766e7c0efb36b508d259746a6a92b02c4d423d39940d5a.png)\n\n  \n\nGiven the number line above, which of the following statements are true?\n\nI. $AC=BD$\n\nII. $\\overline{AB} \\cong \\overline{CD}$\n\nIII. $\\overline{AB}$ is congruent to $\\overline{BD}$",
  "worked_solution": "Let's go through the statements one by one.\n\n- Statement I is true. Indeed, we have that $AC= BD=5$ units.\n\n- Statement II is true. Since $AB=CD=3$ units, we have that $\\overline{AB} \\cong \\overline{CD}$.\n\n- Statement III is false since $AB=3$, while $BD = 5.$ So, $\\overline{AB}\\ncong \\overline{BD}$.\n\nTherefore, only statements I and II are true.",
  "calculator_instructions": "",
  "fields": [],
  "problem_field_keys": [],
  "answer_fields_complete": null,
  "result": null,
  "proof_feedback": null,
  "html": "<div id=\"step-8706\" class=\"step\" style=\"display: block\" stepid=\"8706\" steptype=\"example\" contentid=\"2553\">\n            <div class=\"stepHeader\">\n                <div class=\"stepName\">\n                    Example: \n                    <a id=\"stepAnchor-8706\" class=\"stepAnchor\" style=\"font-weight: normal;\" name=\"step-5\">Identifying Congruent Segments on a Number Line</a> \n                </div>      \n                <div class=\"helpButton\" stepid=\"8706\">?</div>\n            </div>\n            \n            <div class=\"exampleQuestion\">\n                <style type=\"text/css\">\n                            .mjpage .MJX-monospace {\n                            font-family: monospace\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage .MJX-sans-serif {\n                            font-family: sans-serif\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage {\n                            display: inline;\n                            font-style: normal;\n                            font-weight: normal;\n                            line-height: normal;\n                            font-size: 100%;\n                            font-size-adjust: none;\n                            text-indent: 0;\n                            text-align: left;\n                            text-transform: none;\n                            letter-spacing: normal;\n                            word-spacing: normal;\n                            word-wrap: normal;\n                            white-space: nowrap;\n                            float: none;\n                            direction: ltr;\n                            max-width: none;\n                            max-height: none;\n                            min-width: 0;\n                            min-height: 0;\n                            border: 0;\n                            padding: 0;\n                            margin: 0\n                        